    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Thank you, Lin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "It is not yet time for thanks."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "I'm not just talking about today. It's been many years."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034#9",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "...The sun is up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034#9",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "It 's the first time for me to see the sunrise here. The last time we stood shoulder to shoulder like this, was a time of terrible bloodshed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034#11",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "The way the tenements in the slums wrap around each other, causing the shadows to criss cross over themselves, it's not the kind of thing you should get used to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034#11",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Then, after all these years, what is it you see here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_034",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "...Changes, Mr. Wei."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "On that road we walked..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "...there is long since no one behind us."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.6
    },
